      "worked_solution": "Given a decoupled system of first-order linear ODEs in the form\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14118303/assets/76d2ead9af864038020dd009a4ccdab83f344fd482e79f91d39e8b1b5fe961b0.svg)\nthe formula for the general solution is\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14118303/assets/424eabad4ac255cfffff531efdc520e36882be7de882746d90fb4e2fd8387f4b.svg)\n\nFirst, we write our differential equation in matrix form:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14118303/assets/d60622a5da3d4019a72cbe8feed996960881d0b0bc1b1110895f84df0b8c1fd3.svg)\n\nSince the matrix of the differential system is diagonal, the system is decoupled. \n\nTherefore, the general solution is given by\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/multivariable/14118303/assets/b36de43b32d10917081a05fba65da50dc527b9649a80d27b6b3dc2db91310889.svg)",
